python-pytz: accurate and cross platform timezone calculations using Python 2.3
python-pytz: or higher. It also solves the issue of ambiguous times at the end
python-pytz: of daylight savings, which you can read more about in the Python
python-pytz: Library Reference (datetime.tzinfo).
